   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1172,
   "width": 897.6,
   "height": 21.2,
   "text": "It asks; it never refuses \u2014 the stage is a declaration, and an unread check is not an unmet one.",
   "originalText": "It asks; it never refuses \u2014 the stage is a declaration, and an unread check is not an unmet one.",
